All angles are right angles. Find the area of the L-shape in two different ways.

workedExamples.solution_text:
The upper rectangle has height $11-4=7\text{ cm}$. Split along the dashed line.
$\begin{align*} A&=13\times4+5\times7\\ &=52+35\\ &=87\text{ cm}^2 \end{align*}$
Alternatively, split vertically. The lower-right rectangle has width $13-5=8\text{ cm}$.
[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[scale=0.36]
