\node at (9,2) {$A_2$};
\node[below] at (2.5,0) {$5\text{ cm}$};
\node[below] at (9,0) {$8\text{ cm}$};
\node[left] at (0,5.5) {$11\text{ cm}$};
\node[right] at (13,2) {$4\text{ cm}$};
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]
$\begin{align*} A&=5\times11+8\times4\\ &=55+32\\ &=87\text{ cm}^2 \end{align*}$
Both ways count the whole shape once.

